  </tr>
  <tr><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Elementary.ForceAndTorque\">ForceAndTorque</a></td>
      <td> Demonstrates usage of Forces.ForceAndTorque element.<br>
