cumulative(0.5)       // = 0.3934693402873666
cumulative(0.5,0.5,1) // = 0.6321205588285577
</pre></blockquote>

<h4>See also</h4>
<p>
<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Math.Distributions.Weibull.density\">Weibull.density</a>,
