      operator record ComplexPotentialDifference = Complex(redeclare Modelica.Units.SI.PotentialDifference re "Real part of complex potential difference", redeclare Modelica.Units.SI.PotentialDifference im "Imaginary part of complex potential difference") "Complex electric potential difference";
